msgctxt "136"
msgid "...And that's how it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Give the kid a chance. Just one date to see if you jive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Yeah... Please..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "I'm sorry... I'm more interested in this older gentleman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Wait, what!? This older gentleman...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"I'm more into mature, dependable guys, like him. At least,\r\n"
"that's who I'd rather go on a date with..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "What!? But... no..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Hey! What's the big idea!? This isn't how it was supposed\r\n"
"to go at all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Why am I the bad guy here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"You came by a half-dozen times to buy burgers, but it was\r\n"
"all because you had a crush on me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "No! I mean, I just think you're...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"Then why didn't you just ask me out on a date? I'm not\r\n"
"really attracted to guys who don't have the courage to\r\n"
"do something like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Ugh..."
msgstr "Uff..."

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"Sorry if this is weird, but would you read this letter he wrote for you? It "
"explains just how he feels about you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Oh... All right."
msgstr "Uff... Va bene."

msgctxt "340"
msgid "Um, please read it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "...Well?"
msgstr "...Allora?"

msgctxt "388"
msgid ""
"Oh... Okay, I understand how you feel about me now. To be\r\n"
"honest, mature, dependable men like this man are more my\r\n"
"type, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"You bought so many burgers, and you seem really sincere\r\n"
"in this letter... I guess I wouldn't mind going on one date\r\n"
"with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Really!?"
msgstr "Davvero!?"

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Good for you. I'm glad it worked out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"I've got a few hours left on my shift, but I'll send you a\r\n"
"text when I'm off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Okay! Thank you so much!"
msgstr "Okay. Grazie mille!"

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Can I get a hamburger?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "Huh!? Why are you⑬ No! We don't need any more burgers!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "Umm, would you like to order, or..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Not now. Sorry about the confusion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"The only reason this guy's been buying boatloads of burgers is because he "
"likes you and wants to ask you out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "Huh? But I'm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "Would you consider going out on a date with him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "...I'll go on a date."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Huh!?"
msgstr "Eh!?"

msgctxt "580"
msgid "...With this older gentleman here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "604"
msgid "Whaaaaaaaaaaaaa!?"
msgstr "Cooooosa!?"

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"I like guys who are mature and reliable, like this gentleman\r\n"
"here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "Huh!? But what about me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid ""
"Sorry, but you're not really my type. I might've given you a\r\n"
"chance if you'd asked me out on your own, but... I like guys\r\n"
"who've got the courage to actually ask me out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid ""
"Hey! What's the big idea!? This isn't how it was supposed\r\n"
"to go at all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "...Why am I the bad guy here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"I might've thought about it if you'd asked me out, but...\r\n"
"I'm not into guys who don't at least have a little courage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "Ugh..."
msgstr "Uff..."

